			<TITLE>a roofless temple hall</TITLE>
			<DESCRIPTION select="all">
				<DESCRIPTION select="any-1">
					<DESCRIPTION>The roof of this great hall fell in long ago, and the sky shows above. </DESCRIPTION>
					<DESCRIPTION>A dry fountain stands in the middle of this courtyard. </DESCRIPTION>
					<DESCRIPTION>Cracked basins and tiled floors remain of a once $adj_fancy bathhouse. </DESCRIPTION>
				</DESCRIPTION>
				<DESCRIPTION select="any-1">
					<DESCRIPTION>Statues lie face down in the dirt. </DESCRIPTION>
					<DESCRIPTION>Bandit campfires have blackened one corner. </DESCRIPTION>
